rticipate in the draw  for that time slot.\",slotParticipationSponsors:\"The providers include Advant Play, FastSpin, Microgaming, NextSpin and FA CHAI .\",timeSlotDraws:\"One draw every 3 hours, with 8 draws per day.\",multipleDrawsNote:\"You can participate in multiple time slot draws, with prizes ranging from $8 to $88.\",multipleDrawsNoteDec:\"You can participate in multiple time slot draws to win the following prizes, with no duplicate prize amounts on the same day.\",luckyPrizes:\"Lucky players can randomly win $8, $18, $28, $38, $48, $58, $68, $78, or $88.\",termsTitle:\"Terms and Conditions\",eligibility:\"Eligibility Verification: The platform reserves the right to disqualify any participants involved in fraudulent activity.\",fairPlay:\"Fair Play Policy: All players have equal chances to win, and multiple wins are allowed.\",finalDecision:\"Final Decision: The platform's decision regarding this event is final and binding, without dispute.\",usdPrizes:\"Prizes are calculated in USD, and exchange rate fluctuations do not affect the prize amount.\",modificationRights:\"The platform reserves the right to modify or terminate this event at any time without notice.\",sponsorsCarouselTitle:\"Lineup of Sponsors\",sectionTitle1:\"Lucky Star Grand Prize\",winnerTitle:\"November Big Winner\",winnerTitleDec:\"Big Winner\",betTimePrefix:\"Bet Time \",sectionTitle2:\"Daily Winner List\",timeZoneNote:\"The time below is displayed in GMT-4.\",month1:\"January\",month2:\"February\",month3:\"March\",month4:\"April\",month5:\"May\",month6:\"June\",month7:\"July\",month8:\"August\",month9:\"September\",month10:\"October\",month11:\"November\",month12:\"December\",currency:\"USD\",depositInfo:\"All prizes will be automatically deposited into the winner's account every Tuesday.\",tabLabel:\"Statement\",waiting:\"Waiting\",draw:\"Draw\",placeBetToday:\"Place a Bet Today\",betNowButton:\"Bet Now\",final:\"Final\",days:\"Days\",sponsors:\"Sponsors\",eventEnded:\"This event has ende