oParticipate_Description2\":\"2. Pemain dapat berpartisipasi berkali-kali dalam berbagai sesi waktu dan berhak memenangkan beberapa hadiah.\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Description3\":\"3. Semakin banyak taruhan yang dipasang pemain, semakin tinggi peluang mereka untuk terpilih dalam undian harian.\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Description4\":\"4. Hanya taruhan yang ditempatkan dalam mode <b>Compact dan Galaxy</b> yang akan dianggap sebagai tiket partisipasi.\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Title\":\"Pengumuman Hadiah\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description1\":\"<b>Daily Announcements</b>\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description2\":\"Hadiah hingga <b>$100</b> pada hari kerja dan lebih besar hingga <b>$200</b> pada akhir pekan.\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description3\":\"Pemenang harian akan diumumkan pada hari berikutnya di halaman acara dengan sebagian informasi disembunyikan.\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description4\":\"(Pemenang dapat melihat username mereka ditampilkan.)\",\"lbl_LD_PrizePool_Title\":\"Prize Pool & Distribution\",\"lbl_LD_PrizePool_Description1\":\"Total hadiah sebesar <b>$8,000</b> akan dibagi di antara banyak pemenang.\",\"lbl_LD_PrizePool_Description2\":\"Semua hadiah akan <b>dikreditkan ke akun pemenang pada hari berikutnya.</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Title\":\"Aturan & Regulasi\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description1\":\"<b>1.  Game yang Memenuhi Syarat</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description2\":\"<b>Taruhan minimum $2</b> yang ditempatkan di situs lisensi Permainan Angka akan memenuhi syarat untuk undian.\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description3\":\"(Silakan lihat lembar kurs jika Anda menggunakan mata uang selain USD.)\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description4\":\"<b>2. Kebijakan Fair Play</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description5\":\"Pemain di situs lisensi Permainan Angka memiliki akses yang sama ke undian harian, dan kemenangan berulang diperbolehkan.\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description6\":\"<b>3. Pembayaran Hadiah</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description7\":\"Semua hadiah sepenuhnya ditanggung oleh SABA Sports.\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description8\":\"<b>4. Alokasi Hadiah Secara Acak</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description9\":\"Hadiah akan diberikan secara acak selama periode promosi.\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description10\":\"<b>5. Mata Uang Hadiah</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description11\":\"Hadiah dalam mata uang berbeda akan didasarkan pada <b>kurs tetap yang ditetapkan di awal promosi</b> dan <b>tidak akan berubah, terlepas dari fluktuasi pasar.</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description12\":\"(Silakan lihat lembar kurs jika Anda menggunakan mata uang selain USD.)\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description13\":\"<b>6. Kebijakan</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description14\":\"Keputusan platform mengenai acara ini bersifat final dan mengikat.\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description15\":\"Kami berhak untuk mengubah atau menghentikan acara kapan saja tanpa pemberitahuan sebelumnya.\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description16\":\"<b>7. Daftar Kurs Mata Uang</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_MainCurrency\":\"Main Currency\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_MinimumBet\":\"<b>Minimum bet</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Prize1\":\"<b>Prize 1 (200USD)</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Prize2\":\"<b>Prize 2 (100USD)</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Prize3\":\"<b>Prize 3 (50USD)</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_USD\":\"USD $\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_RM\":\"RM\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_CNY\":\"CNY  ¥\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_IDR\":\"IDR Rp(1:1000)\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_THB\":\"THB ฿\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_INH\":\"INH ₫ (1:000)\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_KRW\":\"KRW ₩\"}'),g4=JSON.parse('{\"lbl_sucbet\":\"Bet Success\",\"OddsTempClosed\":\"The odds is temporarily closed.\",\"lbl_BO\":\"B/O\",\"lbl_BE\":\"B/E\",\"lbl_SO\":\"S/O\",\"lbl_SE\":\"S/E\",\"lbl_LD_Title\":\"WIN DROP!\",\"lbl_LD_Subtitle\":\"NUMBER GAMES EDITION\",\"lbl_LD_Start\":\"Start In\",\"lbl_LD_Tab_Weekdays\":\"WEEKDAYS\",\"lbl_LD_Tab_Weekends\":\"WEEKENDS\",\"lbl_LD_UserName\":\"User Name\",\"lbl_LD_WinPrice\":\"Winning Prize\",\"lbl_LD_No_Winner\":\"No winners list available yet.\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Title\":\"How to Participate\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Description1\":\"1. Start of a <b>minimum bet of $2</b> on Number Games licensee sites during the promo period are eligible to win.\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Description2\":\"2. Players can participate multiple times across different time slots and are eligible to win multiple prizes.\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Description3\":\"3. The more players bets, the higher their chance of being selected in the daily draws.\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Description4\":\"4. Only bets on <b>Compact and Galaxy view</b> will be considered as participating ticket.\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Title\":\"Prize Announcement\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description1\":\"<b>Daily Announcements</b>\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description2\":\"Prize will up to <b>$100 during weekdays</b> and even more <b>bigger up to $200</b> on Weekends.\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description3\":\"Daily winners will be announce the following day on the event page with partial information being hidden.\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description4\":\"(Winner itself will saw their username being displayed.)\",\"lbl_LD_PrizePool_Title\":\"Prize Pool & Distribution\",\"lbl_LD_PrizePool_Description1\":\"The Total prize pool is <b>$8,000</b> split among multiple winners.\",\"lbl_LD_PrizePool_Description2\":\"All rewards will be <b>credited to the winners accounts the next day.</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Title\":\"Rules & Regulations\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description1\":\"<b>1. Eligible Games</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description2\":\"A <b>minimum bet of $2</b> placed on Number Games Licensee site will qualify for the draws.\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description3\":\"（Please refer to exchange rate sheet if you\\'re non-USD currency user)\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description4\":\"<b>2. Fair Play Policy</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description5\":\"Players on Number Game licensee site have equal access to the daily draws, multiple wins are allowed.\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description6\":\"<b>3. Prize payment</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description7\":\"All prizes are fully covered by SABA Sports\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description8\":\"<b>4. Random Prize Allocation</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description9\":\"The prize will drop randomly within the promotional period.\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description10\":\"<b>5. Prize currency</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description11\":\"The player\\'s prize in different currencies will be based on the <b>fixed exchange rate set at the start of the promotion</b> and <b>will not change, regardless of market fluctuations.</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description12\":\"（Please refer to exchange rate sheet if you\\'re non-USD currency user)\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description13\":\"<b>6. Policy</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description14\":\"The platform’s decisions regarding the event are final and binding. \",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description15\":\"We reserves the right to modify or terminate the event at any time without prior notice.\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description16\":\"<b>7. Currency exchange rate list</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_MainCurrency\":\"Main Currency\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_MinimumBet\":\"<b>Minimum bet</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Prize1\":\"<b>Prize 1 (200USD)</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Prize2\":\"<b>Prize 2 (100USD)</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Prize3\":\"<b>Prize 3 (50USD)</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_USD\":\"USD $\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_RM\":\"RM\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_CNY\":\"CNY  ¥\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_IDR\":\"IDR Rp(1:1000)\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_THB\":\"THB ฿\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_INH\":\"INH ₫ (1:000)\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_KRW\":\"KRW ₩\"}'),c4=JSON.parse('{\"lbl_sucbet\":\"การเดิมพันสำเร็จ\",\"OddsTempClosed\":\"ปิดอัตราต่อรองชั่วคราว\",\"lbl_BO\":\"B/O\",\"lbl_BE\":\"B/E\",\"lbl_SO\":\"S/O\",\"lbl_SE\":\"S/E\",\"lbl_LD_Title\":\"WIN DROP!\",\"lbl_LD_Subtitle\":\"NUMBER GAMES EDITION\",\"lbl_LD_Start\":\"เริ่มต้นที่\",\"lbl_LD_Tab_Weekdays\":\"วันธรรมดา\",\"lbl_LD_Tab_Weekends\":\"วันสุดสัปดาห์\",\"lbl_LD_UserName\":\"ชื่อผู้ใช้\",\"lbl_LD_WinPrice\":\"รางวัลชนะเลิศ\",\"lbl_LD_No_Winner\":\"अभी तक कोई विजेता सूची उपलब्ध नहीं है\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Title\":\"วิธีเข้าร่วม\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Description1\":\"1. <b>วางเดิมพันขั้นต่ำ $2</b> บนเว็บไซต์เกมหมายเลขที่ได้รับอนุญาตในช่วงระยะเวลาโปรโมชั่นเพื่อรับสิทธิ์ลุ้นรางวัล\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Description2\":\"2. ผู้เล่นสามารถเข้าร่วมได้หลายครั้งในช่วงเวลาต่างๆ และสามารถรับรางวัลได้หลายครั้ง\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Description3\":\"3. ยิ่งเดิมพันมาก ยิ่งมีโอกาสถูกสุ่มเลือกในรางวัลประจำวันมากขึ้น\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Description4\":\"4.  เฉพาะการเดิมพันในมุมมอง <b>Compact และ Galaxy</b> เท่านั้นที่จะถือว่าเป็นตั๋วเข้าร่วมกิจกรรม\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Title\":\"การประกาศรางวัล\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description1\":\"<b>ประกาศรางวัลรายวัน</b>\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description2\":\"รางวัลสูงสุด <b>$100</b> ในวันธรรมดา และสูงสุดถึง <b>$200</b> ในวันสุดสัปดาห์\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description3\":\"ประกาศรายชื่อผู้ชนะในวันถัดไปบนหน้าอีเวนต์ พร้อมซ่อนข้อมูลบางส่วนเพื่อความเป็นส่วนตัว\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description4\":\"(ผู้ชนะจะสามารถเห็นชื่อผู้ใช้ของตนที่แสดงอยู่)\",\"lbl_LD_PrizePool_Title\":\"เงินรางวัลรวม & การแจกจ่ายรางวัล\",\"lbl_LD_PrizePool_Description1\":\"เงินรางวัลรวม <b>$8,000</b> กระจายให้กับผู้ชนะหลายคน.\",\"lbl_LD_PrizePool_Description2\":\"รางวัลทั้งหมดจะถูกโอนเข้าบัญชีของผู้ชน <b>ะในวันถัดไป</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Title\":\"Rกฎและข้อกำหนด\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description1\":\"<b>1. เกมที่มีสิทธิ์เข้าร่วม</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description2\":\"A <b>ต้องวางเดิมพันขั้นต่ำ $2 </b> บนเว็บไซต์เกมหมายเลขที่ได้รับอนุญาตเพื่อเข้าร่วมการจับรางวัล\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description3\":\"（สำหรับผู้ใช้ที่ไม่ใช่สกุลเงิน USD กรุณาดูตารางอัตราแลกเปลี่ยน)\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description4\":\"<b>2. นโยบายการเล่นที่ยุติธรรม</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description5\":\"ผู้เล่นทุกคนบนเว็บไซต์เกมหมายเลขมีสิทธิ์เข้าร่วมการจับรางวัลอย่างเท่าเทียมกัน และสามารถชนะรางวัลได้หลายครั้ง\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description6\":\"<b>3. การจ่ายรางวัล</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description7\":\"รางวัลทั้งหมดได้รับการสนับสนุนโดย SABA Sports\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description8\":\"<b>4. การแจกจ่ายรางวัลแบบสุ่ม</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description9\":\"รางวัลจะถูกแจกแบบสุ่มภายในระยะเวลาโปรโมชั่น\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description10\":\"<b>5. สกุลเงินของรางวัล</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description11\":\"รางวัลของผู้เล่นในสกุลเงินต่างๆ จะถูกกำหนดตามอัตราแลกเปลี่ยนที่ตั้งไว้ตั้งแต่เริ่มโปรโมชั่น และจะไม่เปลี่ยนแปลงตามอัตราตลาด\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description12\":\"（สำหรับผู้ใช้ที่ไม่ใช่สกุลเงิน USD กรุณาดูตารางอัตราแลกเปลี่ยน)\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description13\":\"<b>6. นโยบายกิจกรรม</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description14\":\"การตัดสินใจของแพลตฟอร์มเกี่ยวกับกิจกรรมถือเป็นที่สิ้นสุด \",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description15\":\"ขอสงวนสิทธิ์ในการเปลี่ยนแปลงหรือยกเลิกกิจกรรมได้ทุกเมื่อโดยไม่ต้องแจ้งให้ทราบล่วงหน้า\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description16\":\"<b>7. ตารางอัตราแลกเปลี่ยนเงินตรา</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_MainCurrency\":\"Main Currency\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_MinimumBet\":\"<b>Minimum bet</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Prize1\":\"<b>Prize 1 (200USD)</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Prize2\":\"<b>Prize 2 (100USD)</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Prize3\":\"<b>Prize 3 (50USD)</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_USD\":\"USD $\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_RM\":\"RM\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_CNY\":\"CNY  ¥\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_IDR\":\"IDR Rp(1:1000)\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_THB\":\"THB ฿\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_INH\":\"INH ₫ (1:000)\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_KRW\":\"KRW ₩\"}'),A4=JSON.parse('{\"lbl_sucbet\":\"Cược Thành Công\",\"OddsTempClosed\":\"Tỷ lệ cược tạm thời đang đóng.\",\"lbl_BO\":\"B/O\",\"lbl_BE\":\"B/E\",\"lbl_SO\":\"S/O\",\"lbl_SE\":\"S/E\",\"lbl_LD_Title\":\"WIN DROP!\",\"lbl_LD_Subtitle\":\"NUMBER GAMES EDITION\",\"lbl_LD_Start\":\"Bắt Đầu Vào\",\"lbl_LD_Tab_Weekdays\":\"Ngày thường\",\"lbl_LD_Tab_Weekends\":\"Cuối tuần\",\"lbl_LD_UserName\":\"User Name\",\"lbl_LD_WinPrice\":\"Winning Prize\",\"lbl_LD_No_Winner\":\"Chưa có danh sách người chiến thắng\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Title\":\"Cách tham gia\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Description1\":\"1. Đặt cược tối thiểu <b>$2</b> trên các trang web của Number Game trong thời gian khuyến mãi để có cơ hội chiến thắng.\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Description2\":\"2. Người chơi có thể tham gia nhiều lần trong các khung giờ khác nhau và có thể chiến thắng nhiều giải.\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Description3\":\"3. Càng cá cược nhiều, cơ hội được chọn trong các lần quay số hàng ngày càng cao.\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Description4\":\"4. Chỉ những cược đặt trên giao diện <b>Compact và Galaxy mới</b> được tính là vé tham gia.\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Title\":\"Công bố giải thưởng\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description1\":\"<b>Công bố hàng ngày</b>\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description2\":\"Giải thưởng có giá trị lên đến <b>$100</b> vào các ngày trong tuần và tới đa lên đến <b>$200</b> vào cuối tuần.\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description3\":\"Người chiến thắng hàng ngày sẽ được công bố vào ngày hôm sau trên trang sự kiện với một phần thông tin được che giấu.\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description4\":\"(Người chiến thắng sẽ thấy tên người dùng của mình được hiển thị.)\",\"lbl_LD_PrizePool_Title\":\"Quỹ giải thưởng & Phân bổ\",\"lbl_LD_PrizePool_Description1\":\"Tổng quỹ giải thưởng là <b>$8,000</b> được chia cho nhiều người chiến thắng.\",\"lbl_LD_PrizePool_Description2\":\"Tất cả giải thưởng sẽ được <b>ghi cóng vào tài khoản của người chiến thắng vào ngày hôm sau.</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Title\":\"Quy tắc & điều kiện\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description1\":\"<b>1. Trò chơi hợp lệ</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description2\":\"A Cược tối thiểu <b>$2</b> đặt trên trang web Number Game sẽ đủ điều kiện tham gia quay số.\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description3\":\"(Vui lòng tham khảo bảng tỷ giá nếu bạn sử dụng tiền tệ không phải USD)\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description4\":\"<b>2. Chính sách chơi công bằng</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description5\":\"Người chơi trên trang web Number Game có quyền tham gia quay số hàng ngày ngang nhau, có thể chiến thắng nhiều lần.\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description6\":\"<b>3. Thanh toán giải thưởng</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description7\":\"Tất cả giải thưởng đều do SABA Sports đảm bảo chi trả.\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description8\":\"<b>4. Phân phối giải ngẫu nhiên</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description9\":\"Giải thưởng sẽ được phát ngẫu nhiên trong thời gian khuyến mãi.\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description10\":\"<b>5. Tiền tệ giải thưởng</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description11\":\"Giá trị giải thưởng của người chơi trong các loại tiền tệ khác nhau sẽ dựa trên tỷ giá cố định được đặt ra vào bắt đầu khuyến mãi và không thay đổi dù tỷ giá thị trường có biến động. \",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description12\":\"(Vui lòng tham khảo bảng tỷ giá nếu bạn sử dụng tiền tệ không phải USD)\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description13\":\"<b>6. Chính sách</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description14\":\"Quyết định của nền tảng đối với sự kiện là cuối cùng và có tính rắng buộc.\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description15\":\"Chúng tôi bảo lưu quyền thay đổi hoặc hủy bỏ sự kiện bất cứ lúc nào mà không cần báo trước.\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description16\":\"<b>7. Danh sách tỷ giá trao đổi</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_MainCurrency\":\"Main Currency\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_MinimumBet\":\"<b>Minimum bet</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Prize1\":\"<b>Prize 1 (200USD)</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Prize2\":\"<b>Prize 2 (100USD)</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Prize3\":\"<b>Prize 3 (50USD)</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_USD\":\"USD $\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_RM\":\"RM\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_CNY\":\"CNY  ¥\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_IDR\":\"IDR Rp(1:1000)\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_THB\":\"THB ฿\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_INH\":\"INH ₫ (1:000)\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_KRW\":\"KRW ₩\"}'),u4=JSON.parse('{\"lbl_sucbet\":\"投注成功\",\"OddsTempClosed\":\"本赔率暂时关闭。\",\"lbl_BO\":\"大/单\",\"lbl_BE\":\"大/双\",\"lbl_SO\":\"小/单\",\"lbl_SE\":\"小/双\",\"lbl_LD_Title\":\"WIN DROP!\",\"lbl_LD_Subtitle\":\"百练赛特別版\",\"lbl_LD_Start\":\"开始时间\",\"lbl_LD_Tab_Weekdays\":\"平日\",\"lbl_LD_Tab_Weekends\":\"周末\",\"lbl_LD_UserName\":\"用户名\",\"lbl_LD_WinPrice\":\"奖项\",\"lbl_LD_No_Winner\":\"尚未有得奖名单\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Title\":\"如何参与\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Description1\":\"1. 在活动期间，于百练赛最低投注 <b>$2</b> 即可获得中奖资格。\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Description2\":\"2. 玩家可以在不同时间段多次参与，并有机会多次获奖。\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Description3\":\"3. 投注越多，被选中为每日获奖者的概率越大。\",\"lbl_LD_HowToParticipate_Description4\":\"4. 仅<b>**轻量版和银河版**</b>的投注将被视为有效参与。\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Title\":\"奖项公布\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description1\":\"<b>每日公告</b>\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description2\":\"周间最高可赢 <b>$100</b>，周末更有机会赢取高达 <b>$200</b>！\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description3\":\"每日获奖名单将在次日公布于活动页面，并隐藏部分信息。\",\"lbl_LD_PrizeAnnouncement_Description4\":\"获奖者本人可看到自己的完整使用者名称。\",\"lbl_LD_PrizePool_Title\":\"奖池 & 奖励分配\",\"lbl_LD_PrizePool_Description1\":\"总奖池：<b>$8,000</b>，将分配给多名获奖者。\",\"lbl_LD_PrizePool_Description2\":\"所有奖励将在次日直接发放至获奖者账户。\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Title\":\"规则 & 规定\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description1\":\"<b>1. 合规投注</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description2\":\"最低投注 <b>$2</b> 于百练赛可参与抽奖。\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description3\":\"（非美元用户请参考汇率表）\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description4\":\"<b>2. 公平游戏政策</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description5\":\"所有玩家享有平等抽奖机会，且可多次获奖。\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description6\":\"<b>3. 奖金支付 </b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description7\":\"奖金将全数由沙巴体育负担。\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description8\":\"<b>4. 随机奖项分配</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description9\":\"奖励将在活动期间随机掉落。\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description10\":\"<b>5. 奖项币别</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description11\":\"玩家的奖励将按照活动开始时的固定汇率兑换，并不会因市场波动而调整。\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description12\":\"（非美元用户请参考汇率表）\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description13\":\"<b>6. 政策调整</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description14\":\"平台对本活动拥有最终解释权，所有决定具有约束力。 \",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description15\":\"平台保留随时修改或终止活动的权利，无需另行通知。\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Description16\":\"<b>7. 货币兑换汇率列表</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_MainCurrency\":\"主要币别\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_MinimumBet\":\"<b>最小投注</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Prize1\":\"<b>奖项 1 (200USD)</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Prize2\":\"<b>奖项 2 (100USD)</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_Prize3\":\"<b>奖项 3 (50USD)</b>\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_USD\":\"美元（USD）\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_RM\":\"马来西亚令吉（RM）\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_CNY\":\"人民币（CNY）\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_IDR\":\"印尼盾（IDR）(1:1000)\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_THB\":\"泰铢（THB）\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_INH\":\"越南盾（INH） (1:000)\",\"lbl_LD_Rules_KRW\":\"韩元（KRW）\"}'),d4=JSON.parse('{\"lbl_sucbet\":\"投注成功\",\"OddsTempClosed\":\"本赔率暂时关闭。\",\"lbl_BO\":\"